== Dungeon Orb Abilities ==
*{{AN|Throwing Axe}}: Throw an Axe, doing the damage of your highest damage hit in the last minute. {{Cooldown|10}}
*{{AN|Ragnarok}}: Grants 100 {{Stat|bas}}, 400 {{Stat|speed}}, and a 50% damage increase for 15 seconds. Also summons 3 Zombie minions to aid you in battle! {{Cooldown|60}}

== Ghost Abilities ==
*{{AN|Buff Potion}}: Throw a potion which temporarily gives all [[Dungeons|teammates]] in a 10 block radius {{stat|str|+30}}
*{{AN|Ghost Axe}}: Throw an Axe, dealing damage based on your berserker level!

== Leveling Rewards ==
{{/Skill UI}}

For every Berserk level up to level 50 you get:
*+ 0.75% Melee Damage
*+ 0.4% Bloodlust Damage
*+ 1% Throwing Axe Damage
*+ 50-1000 Ghost Axe Damage
*+ 800-16000 Ragnarok Minions Health
*+ 3% Lust for Blood Damage Increase Per Hit

For every 5 Berserk Levels you also get:
*+ 0.4 {{stat|spd}}
*+ 2 Ghost Potion {{stat|str}}
*+ 100% Lust for Blood Damage Increase Cap

At level 50 you receive the following buffs:

* +37.5% Melee Damage, for a total of +77.5% Melee Damage
* +20% Bloodlust Damage, for a total of +40% 
* +50% Throwing axe Damage
* {{Stat|speed|+4}}, for a total of {{Stat|speed|+34}}
* +20 Ghost Potion {{stat|str}}, for a total of {{Stat|strength|+50}}
*+1000% Lust for Blood Damage Increase Cap, for a total of 1100%

